                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "content": "Counterfactual Explanations for Clinical Decision Support",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.4,
                                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                      "fontSize": 16,
                                      "fontWeight": "700"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "qjIUj",
                                      "fill": "#555555",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "content": "提出生成临床场景反事实样本以提升模型可解释性的方法，覆盖三家医院真实病例数据，重点验证临床医生对解释结果的可接受度与决策影响。结果显示采纳率提升 23%。",
