                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "DJBVk",
                          "fill": "#333333",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "对比 Attention Heat-map / Grad-CAM / Integrated Gradients 三类常用可解释性方法在医学影像辅助诊断中的表现。邀请 12 位放射科医师对 NIH ChestX-ray14 与 MIMIC-CXR 共 10,247 例胸片进行盲测，量化解释质量与诊断信心之间的关系。结果表明 Grad-CAM 信心评分提升 18%，Attention Map 一致性提升 12%，p<0.01。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.7,
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
